        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          49 Gaypui Taanv Taanh Khang Tei",
            "                        11.11.11. 12. Ref. 9. 10. 10.9",
            "          Doh hei Ab",
            "",
            "          1. Gaypui taanv taanh khang tei nang pumc tiipat ro;",
            "             Heic khoutei Poubauhmei lungh kiangclou pwni.",
            "             Gaypui taanv taanh khangtei kaganv reicpat ro;",
            "             Poubauhmei taanv taanh khang kaganv rau guang pw the.",
            "",
            "                  Jisu khou lwmlou makmei guay mu,",
            "                  Kandih khouhei lungc nchamc khwan sihnic,",
            "                  Tingkauh thangc guang kariu datpui kaanc khou,",
            "                  Aniw zaw how ntangh mak nuh e.",
            "",
            "          2. Kaganv hei dui the, tingmik hei rau guang the.",
            "             Mbaanv chwn guay mpatlouna lunghlaic tho,",
            "             Kaipouc rui chaengmun khou dingna khwan bam the.",
            "             Kamei nunc guay ta laa khang nkhwanna bam the.",
            "",
            "          3. Tingkauh ramc gay khoutei tingsaeng zaeng lungc ni.",
            "             Bw lev neih, gaanchuangcna gaanhmei nai lak khe.",
            "             Mikdui keymei hei khat sihnic nai lak khe.",
            "             Tingkwm aching ching Jisu lev lungc chamc pwní."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
